From: Asgard
Subject: [PATCH] Input: rsinput: Kettle 1381 + 1440 + 1444 resume init on top of ours

Kettle 1381 (balance the supply, retry a failed resume init), 1440 (wait
for the params ack, a status report counts as one; every retry
power-cycles the MCU; resume init runs from a work off the resume path;
buttons reported whole) and 1444 (reopen the UART before retrying a
failed resume: 1 in 14 Portal resumes left a dead pad). 1440 supersedes
our 9006 status-stream check and the version_ack_pending window.
Keeps our 1023 oversized-chunk slicing, which Kettle drops instead.
Generated as the whole-file result: Kettle 91e3b5c rsinput.c + 1023.
